  "title": "Spain's Prime Minister and Migration Crisis in Ceuta",
  "summary": "Spain's prime minister, Pedro Sánchez, condemned the influx of 60,000 migrants from Morocco to the Spanish enclave of Ceuta, leading to political and humanitarian challenges. The crisis highlighted the ongoing tensions between Spain's pro-immigration policies and the growing migrant crisis.",
