    {
      "statement": "The influx led to a political crisis in Madrid and caused criticism from other EU countries.",
      "confidence": 0.95
    },
    {
      "statement": "The sudden migration overwhelmed the city of Ceuta, prompting calls for Spain to suspend its Schengen agreement with Morocco.",
