      "title": "Spain's PM blames traffickers after 60,000 migrants reach Ceuta from Morocco",
      "link": "https://www.bbc.co.uk/news/articles/cx2kp639yx4o?at_medium=RSS&at_campaign=rss",
      "description": "Spain said most had returned to Morocco by Friday evening, as Italy suspended its Schengen agreement on free movement with Madrid.",
      "source_name": "BBC World News",
      "published": "2026-07-31T17:03:47"
